v 3
d calligram: word clouds in any shape, from survey text to maps
d
d Author: Fahad Mirza
d Support: https://github.com/fahad-mirza/calligram_Stata/issues
d
d calligram turns a text variable into a word cloud: an interactive HTML
d page that works offline, and PNG, JPG or SVG pictures. Words are packed by
d the shape of their letters and never overlap. Clouds can fill named
d shapes, an image, or the areas of a shapefile, with each word inside its
d own area (a city in its country) or near its real location. Text handling:
d stopwords (English, French, Spanish, Portuguese), plurals, hyphenated
d words, two-word phrases; by() groups, weights, if/in, pre-counted words,
d colour by a variable, and results saved as a dataset. A bundled Java
d engine runs on Stata's own Java (nothing else to install). Stata 17+.
d
d Example data and the gallery do-file: net get calligram
d
d Version 1.0.4 (Beta). Formerly wordcloud2 3.5.
d KW: word cloud
d KW: wordcloud
d KW: text analysis
d KW: survey responses
d KW: maps
